    {
      "name": "Deny the Witch",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor48It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When a psyker within Medium Range of the Battle Sister Manifests a power, they may use their Reaction to attempt to disrupt it. The Battle Sister makes a Willpower Test with the same Difficulty as the Psychic Power. If they succeed, subtract their SL from the psyker's SL. This may reduce their SL below 1 and cause the psychic power to fail.   Storm of Retribution: When a Sister Retributor makes an Overwatch action, they may choose two triggers rather than one, and make Ranged Attacks from the Overwatch Action with Advantage.  True Faith: The Battle Sister has 1 point of Fate.</p>"
        },
